# Runtime SQLite snapshot — shipped via the `data-latest` GitHub Release, not git.
# Committing this ~10 MB binary hourly bloated the repo and broke Streamlit Cloud's
# deploy clone (283 MB / ~140 s). Workflows download it at start and upload it at end.
